## ✅ Result

- PIM role settings configured
- Activation requires MFA, justification, and approval
- Role converted from Active to Eligible
- Full activation cycle tested
- Role shows expiry countdown (not permanent)

---

## 💡 Key Takeaways

- **Eligible assignments** require activation; **Active** assignments are always on
- **Just-in-Time access** minimizes standing admin privileges
- **Approval workflows** enforce separation of duties
- **MFA + justification** create an audit trail
- **Time-bound access** limits exposure window

---

## 🔗 Active vs Eligible

| Aspect | Active | Eligible |
|--------|--------|----------|
| Access | Immediate | Requires activation |
| Duration | Permanent or time-bound | Time-bound after activation |
| MFA | Not required | Configurable |
| Justification | No | Yes |
| Approval | No | Configurable |
| Security Risk | Higher | Lower |
